{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/fsf60ovm59ife345a26r2wic242xucx.mp3","text":"作战任务分配好了？没有的话，我可以再等等......","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7d/ku53n78eiuw0jmjo4ns5zg26tpk0ozi.mp3","text":"保持冷静，继续前行。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/msoyoyu8tz42wdtxe4ij36tke1o9olw.mp3","text":"以前的伙食还挺不错的，但自从和因陀罗她们在一起之后......变得糟透了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/91/dxvqq0zxrnhlcbp9hkdtosn7djskz0g.mp3","text":"我做了个梦......那是太阳升起的地方。视线无法触及之处，我的祖国就在那里......我或许，再也回不去了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/01/25xks2vdxlqy7m71mq0sqhpe28d7fl7.mp3","text":"回过神来，已经习惯了这种漂泊的生活，真奇妙啊——这是我从来没有想象过的事。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/065y20fr1tu1gu3vlt4rii2otr8gmht.mp3","text":"你说高文他们？......与其说是我遇见他们，倒不如说是他们捡到了我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/e3g7opx7y8hy5omvigbhrxj0sy7gewg.mp3","text":"和因陀罗他们在维多利亚的街头并肩作战——回想起来，我也慢慢变得珍惜起这段回忆了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/79/k4zol0mxkznt59rphzfpbkwg0vkeiyu.mp3","text":"别放松警惕......！我知道你已经十分努力了，但仅凭我们现在的力量，总会发生力不能及的事情。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/44/f157jci1jkm3yk0f14x0bg5fvemkfmk.mp3","text":"如果遭遇了无法逃避的难题......我也是会有些许私心的。到那时，博士，希望你也能成为我的......不，没什么。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/ceb7p36ajxhx7wmflj6s3qd2nqyc22i.mp3","text":"......嗯？睡着了？不知你的梦中，是否也会有故乡的景色。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/7okxzbqn9qf4esiv92inmw51lnk2q8j.mp3","text":"力量测试已经通过了吧。那么，请给我些任务，别让这把锤子太无聊。代号？大家都叫我“推进之王”，不是很好记，但我觉得还不错。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/98/hwyy6cmxvd2q8exqnbcu3tse6zq2c8d.mp3","text":"感觉不赖。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/1t1mipr8ut741d79njiyacqepr1d4yo.mp3","text":"晋升？哦——？","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/ptx50plu4y9xn2nd5v3xildjr2qc2wo.mp3","text":"又是晋升？嗯，谢咯。仔细想想还挺奇妙的......因为在过去，做这件事的人是我呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/adj5z5yqmcub2z2rgj19516qu9hafjn.mp3","text":"这，是一场必要的战斗吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/9chnvpc633yfiy5lhd0fa4mmq9tp6st.mp3","text":"可要好好熟悉我的作战风格。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:4/46/p5ew84tkd8bg29wexhnn5771fzer4go.mp3","text":"丢了一个钉子......死了一个国王。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/6o6hec01juw4ixcbybr929v70b43mtv.mp3","text":"逃吧，被当成懦夫总比没命强。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/4qw8uq1oly7220vcnmxu8b5ox2qhrm1.mp3","text":"哦？","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/59/asy3uq419fxomono09szpt982ftbg8o.mp3","text":"准备好了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/itprblzso1us2u8pw29gj35lglwwd5a.mp3","text":"麻烦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/50/g9lwz8329hdooyc57eobpvxstsiue78.mp3","text":"一口气解决。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b3/o26z8q57derdj7j2xhrg6ps344apnt8.mp3","text":"这把武器可非庸人能使。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/n873vcarfev95d3ed95u5kiqce3zrp5.mp3","text":"闪开。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/03/l6snk2rnfpuovjld3o15xhto5vp8hwk.mp3","text":"上了战场，就要有饮败的觉悟！","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/aiwazuan3wa72io7vd4wczmvw0kcekl.mp3","text":"你的生死由我裁定。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/ahj2n9hfnnte4qa6rllrpxo382elt8i.mp3","text":"装模作样，不堪一击。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/af/718ehp1tzsjh5zz1rqp1aei7m4o7jiq.mp3","text":"对拒绝投降者无需怜悯。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/4yrmvgvh0ycs74hws0alzvl5jdeq098.mp3","text":"结束了吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/pkh9dgrmbf9b0ykmw7vbwbpce2fzpg0.mp3","text":"意外的......疲惫......十分抱歉。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/i8vybh0fw1hrapps8cn4658ok97tnig.mp3","text":"能找个地方让我睡一觉吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/ciskesw3cgl4vw22u6xjj4ch4xe3yvy.mp3","text":"嘁——","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/iolnv3db4nbhzh5nfgp7r86vjplfgtt.mp3","text":"外面太吵闹了......你的办公室就不一样，很安静，挺不错的，让我待一会吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/lmmwia4eresc4hxxsengjad0vm1rgkc.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:8/88/rz6h0413y0x4o5xh8nasejf107f35jv.mp3","text":"我仿佛又听到了熟悉的钟声......希望在新的一年，太阳的光芒能够撕裂伦蒂尼姆上空的阴霾。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/47doe15gh5771tir4vwjc0d3mi100oj.mp3","text":"噢！博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_112_siege/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/62/6dz3qp7r5fe9si8n6hxp6q9xdcls1us.mp3","text":"作战任务分配好了？没有的话，我可以再等等......","alt":"voice/char_112_siege/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/lca42lrpd48wcipog520ec5oovxj5gg.mp3","text":"保持冷静，继续前行。","alt":"voice/char_112_siege/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/9fxxtzz1ctrxqshh412f22c1r3f7wad.mp3","text":"以前的伙食还挺不错的，但自从和因陀罗她们在一起之后......变得糟透了。","alt":"voice/char_112_siege/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/bzikc6qvffkbhgwzoir0r1vflv17j8j.mp3","text":"我做了个梦......那是太阳升起的地方。视线无法触及之处，我的祖国就在那里......我或许，再也回不去了。","alt":"voice/char_112_siege/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/86/e707g1lp2e2bxwksasgzykrhz4zszk0.mp3","text":"回过神来，已经习惯了这种漂泊的生活，真奇妙啊——这是我从来没有想象过的事。","alt":"voice/char_112_siege/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/40/7mo0whoefiig35fzv0oz4ztvbx4rkft.mp3","text":"你说高文他们？......与其说是我遇见他们，倒不如说是他们捡到了我。","alt":"voice/char_112_siege/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:1/15/trfexdmvqig2u0wp51uf9urqqhtmn1y.mp3","text":"和因陀罗他们在维多利亚的街头并肩作战——回想起来，我也慢慢变得珍惜起这段回忆了。","alt":"voice/char_112_siege/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/j79ps3aen3bngsc31uppam6a5qxr